{"id": "swebq0189", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2303132607, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "aa7a8a6f2040793a4fe8dabcb6d10f2520887b0e0988d37809c3a27ef31575d8", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 4, "query": "what to see near grand canyon?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0189.wav", "input_sha256": "96d07f9e9415767d55909cacacba16a7dd5f9cbd07e137d29405ddb22a653202", "input_samples": 40849, "input_s": 2.553, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.6524, "act": 0.9957, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "If you mean near the Grand Canyon South Rim, the best things to see are: Mather Point – classic first viewpoint near the Visitor Center. , Yavapai Point & Geology Museum – great canyon views plus geology exhibits. , Rim Trail – easy walk with nonstop views; do any short section. , Grand Canyon Village – historic lodges, Kolb Studio, Hopi House, restaurants. , Hermit Road viewpoints – especially.", "expert_answer": "If you mean **near the Grand Canyon South Rim**, the best things to see are:\n\n1. **Mather Point** – classic first viewpoint near the Visitor Center.\n2. **Yavapai Point & Geology Museum** – great canyon views plus geology exhibits.\n3. **Rim Trail** – easy walk with nonstop views; do any short section.\n4. **Grand Canyon Village** – historic lodges, Kolb Studio, Hopi House, restaurants.\n5. **Hermit Road viewpoints** – especially **Hopi Point**, **Powell Point**, and **Hermits Rest**; shuttle access is commonly used seasonally. ([nps.gov](https://www.nps.gov/grca/planyourvisit/hermit-road.htm?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwi0_t3Mz7_8AhUR1J0KHR_3AO4QyK4DegQIBBAx&utm_source=openai))\n6. **Desert View Drive** – a 23-mile scenic road east of Grand Canyon Village with overlooks and the **Desert View Watchtower**; open to private vehicles year-round. ([nps.gov](https://www.nps.gov/grca/planyourvisit/things2do.htm?utm_source=openai))\n7. **South Kaibab Trail to Ooh Aah Point** – short but steep hike with huge views.\n8. **Bright Angel Trail** – iconic trail from the Village; even a short walk down is memorable.\n9. **Tusayan** – gateway town just outside the South Rim with food, lodging, IMAX, and tours.\n10. **Grand Canyon Railway in Williams** – a fun day-trip option to/from the South Rim.\n\nIf you have extra time nearby:\n- **Horseshoe Bend** near Page, AZ — about 2.5 hours from South Rim.\n- **Antelope Canyon** near Page — guided tours only, also about 2.5 hours away.\n- **Flagstaff** — about 1.5 hours away; good base with restaurants, Route 66, and Lowell Observatory.\n- **Sedona** — about 2–2.5 hours away; red rocks, hikes, scenic drives.\n\nFor a **1-day South Rim plan**: start at **Mather Point**, walk part of the **Rim Trail**, visit **Yavapai Museum**, shuttle or drive viewpoints, then finish sunset at **Hopi Point** or **Desert View**.", "transcript": "What to see near Grand Canyon.\n", "asr_s": 0.56, "expert_s": 10.68, "expert_input_samples": 40849, "expert_input_s": 2.553, "expert_input_sha256": "96d07f9e9415767d55909cacacba16a7dd5f9cbd07e137d29405ddb22a653202", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 10.703, "relay_synth_ms": 19261, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 0, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0189_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "509db6552137bb3845a0dc94bb7a149ac4b0de8c1136f9e677f9790f50f7d9af", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 34.56}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0189_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "56b4c27978f5974f4c4e190c843410c2ddca978754bf0fbf10c37bf1f825a2d6", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0189_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "88bf13795d348ea832bcfc2175812ea5d6a48b6e1c6acf6f8f45eddb220a49ed", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 0.76}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.08, 1.15, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.084, 2.144, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.553, 2.628, 2.687, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.553, 3.631, 4.257, 0, 24000, 0]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 2.553, "last_real_feed_done": 2.628, "onset": 4.257, "gate_read_done": 4.257, "fire": 4.257, "candidate_first_pcm": 4.257, "stall_note": 4.258, "stall_first_pcm": 4.802, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 4.802, "expert_req": 4.257, "expert_resp": 15.505, "relay_synth_start": 15.506, "relay_first_pcm": 16.344, "relay_synth_end": 34.767, "first_any_pcm": 4.257, "first_answer_pcm": 16.344, "session_end": 34.973}, "ttfa_answer_s": 13.791, "ttfa_any_s": 1.703}
